  "description": ".NET library for PESEL, NIP, and REGON. Strongly typed identifiers with validation, parsing, generation, structured error codes, DataAnnotations support, and span-based validation. Targets netstandard2.0 and net10.0.",
  "id": "PolishIdentifiers",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-03-22T00:15:52.983Z",
